{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These are "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"core"}]},{"type":"text","value":" options and API properties for all header groups. More options and API properties may be available for other "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/features.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"table features"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"header-group-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Header Group API"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All header group objects have the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"}]},{"type":"code","value":"id: string","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The unique identifier for the header group."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"depth","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"depth"}]},{"type":"code","value":"depth: number","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The depth of the header group, zero-indexed based."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"headers","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"headers"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type headers = Header<TData>[]","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of "},{"type":"link","href":"./header.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Header"}]},{"type":"text","value":" objects that belong to this header group"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"header-group-api","text":"Header Group API","level":2},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"depth","text":"depth","level":3},{"id":"headers","text":"headers","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all header groups. More options and API properties may be available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Header Group API\n\nAll header group objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe unique identifier for the header group.\n\n### `depth`\n\n```tsx\ndepth: number\n```\n\nThe depth of the header group, zero-indexed based.\n\n### `headers`\n\n```tsx\ntype headers = Header<TData>[]\n```\n\nAn array of [Header](./header.md) objects that belong to this header group\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: HeaderGroup APIs\n---\n\nThese are **core** options and API properties for all header groups. More options and API properties may be available for other [table features](../../guide/features.md).\n\n## Header Group API\n\nAll header group objects have the following properties:\n\n### `id`\n\n```tsx\nid: string\n```\n\nThe unique identifier for the header group.\n\n### `depth`\n\n```tsx\ndepth: number\n```\n\nThe depth of the header group, zero-indexed based.\n\n### `headers`\n\n```tsx\ntype headers = Header<TData>[]\n```\n\nAn array of [Header](./header.md) objects that belong to this header group\n"}
